Advanced Configuration (Optional)
Custom Sidecar Injection Configuration
You can customize sidecar injection behavior using annotations:

Disable injection for specific pods:
metadata:
  annotations:
    sidecar.istio.io/inject: "false"
Specify custom sidecar configuration:
metadata:
  annotations:
    sidecar.istio.io/proxyCPU: "100m"
    sidecar.istio.io/proxyMemory: "128Mi"
Namespace-Level Injection Policy
You can also control injection at the namespace level:

kubectl annotate namespace bookinfo sidecar.istio.io/inject=true
