Why This Matters
Automatic sidecar injection is crucial for service mesh adoption because it:

Simplifies deployment - No need to manually modify application YAML files
Ensures consistency - All pods in enabled namespaces automatically get sidecars
Reduces errors - Eliminates manual configuration mistakes
Enables service mesh features - Provides the foundation for traffic management, security, and observability
